	"data": "2026-10-03\n\nEvents\nChris wants Frame + D435 depth occlusion as an early/primary devlog project. This fills the exact MR gap Road to VR flagged — Arcturus gives color passthrough but no depth/mesh, so virtual objects paint over reality. D435 on Star + depth sidecar + Godot = real occlusion. First devlog: before/after demo of objects disappearing behind real furniture. Flagship differentiator content.\nDaily infra health check 09:42: RAG healthy (5/5 ok, search latency 27s), Docker Optiplex 19/19…",
